&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive public accounting and/or industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting or Finance, with a CPA or equivalent professional accounting qualification&lt;/li&gt;
