&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Analyze complex problem and exercising sound analytical judgment on investigation resolutions or decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
