&lt;li&gt;Set the pace for prioritization and execution, partnering seamlessly with Engineering, Design, Data Science, GTM, Marketing, and Operations teams to launch initiatives aligned with company-wide goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
