&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field plus 4 years of experience in Software Development or a related occupation. Employer is willing to accept a 3 or 4 year US or foreign degree.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have 4 years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
