&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An operational builder&lt;/strong&gt; who combines strong analytical skills (including SQL and data analysis) with a continuous improvement mindset, creating scalable processes, playbooks and documentation that increase team capability and improve the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
