&lt;li&gt;Integrate observability features with popular frontend tools, frameworks, and build systems to enhance developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient, and well-documented code, ensuring platform reliability through thorough testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, designers, and infrastructure teams to solve challenges and deliver top-tier solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the open-source community by contributing to projects and participating in discussions, supporting Vercel’s developer-focused mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect feedback from developers and users to drive continuous innovation and improvement in the observability product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
