&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in abuse prevention, trust &amp;amp; safety, or security engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong programming skills in JavaScript/TypeScript and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
