&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;At Airbnb, we maintain and extend a world-class payments platform that is the engine of commerce and trust for our global community. This platform currently supports 220 countries and over 65 currencies, connecting dozens of payment providers and processing billions of dollars annually. To enable and support growth of the marketplace, we continually innovate unique ways for guests to pay for stays and experiences that are memorable and in many cases life changing.&amp;nbsp; Whether it&#39;s providing accepting relevant forms of payments, breaking payments into more manageable parts, or combining payments for several individuals seeking to travel and share together, Airbnb strives to make paying trips as simple as possible, while protecting our guests and hosts with security and assurances we have their backs every step of the way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Within the payment organization, the platform team comprises individuals that manage our products and experiences related to checkout, payment methods, risk, compliance, and hosts payouts.&amp;nbsp; We are seeking a strong Senior Platform leader to manage all aspects of our &lt;em&gt;guest payment&lt;/em&gt; capabilities and experiences.&amp;nbsp; This includes enabling new global and local payment methods, onboarding and validating methods with our processing partners, managing post transaction interactions such as refunds and transaction reporting, and finally creating and expanding our growing portfolio of installments and financing solutions to help pay for trips and trip related services.&amp;nbsp; This role is a key leadership position within the platform product organization and will report into our Global Director of Payments Platform Product management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver and evolve Guest Payments Platform Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap: Lead the development and execution of the Payments platform strategy and roadmap for Guest Pay-ins, refunds, payment plans, methods and processing resilience.&amp;nbsp; This also includes product leadership working alongside engineering on redundancy,vaulting, processor performance and optimization and availability across the entire payment funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Execution &amp;amp; Delivery: Oversee the end-to-end product development lifecycle for the various sub domains within the guest payment team, from concept and feasibility analysis to execution, launch, and post-launch optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Teams: Guide and collaborate with cross-functional teams (Engineering, Design, Product Marketing, Platform Risk, Compliance, etc.) to deliver high-quality capabilities and ensure dependencies are managed effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development: Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing team of senior platform managers, fostering a culture of excellence and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overarching Payment Platform Strategy: Act as a key contributor to the broader payments platform strategy, providing expert insights on the competitive landscape, emerging technologies, and consumer trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication: Manage stakeholder expectations and present plans, progress, and outcomes to senior leadership and other cross-functional partners to ensure alignment and influence outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence: Define and monitor key product metrics, ensuring product quality and continuous improvement to meet operational and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of product management experience in inbound (pay-ins) and outbound (pay-outs) money movement within a payments, finance, or heavily transactional company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven product management experience with a deep understanding of stakeholder needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills: able to push back, ask questions, and challenge others while creating lasting, collaborative partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with non-product teams such as legal, tax, compliance, risk, and payments operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience working with Engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup experience: comfortable with a fast pace, changing needs, and limited resources. Bonus points if you have also worked at large, scaled organizations and can balance the best of both worlds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesize large amounts of unstructured and diverse information into a single, clear set of requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global perspective: experience building products for different countries and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points for experience with global and local payment methods that are not credit cards and experience across Payments, Risk, and Compliance systems and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb Payments, Inc. (a subsidiary of Airbnb, Inc.) is a registered entity. Approved remote states include: Alabama, California, Colorado, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Maryland, Minnesota, Mississippi, Nevada, New Jersey, New York, North Carolina, Ohio, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Tennessee, Texas, and Washington. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is excluded. If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$232,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$282,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The Senior Quality Lead, Specialty is a newly created senior leadership role accountable for the quality program across several high stakes, high complexity Community Support functions: Safety, Premium Support, and CS Labs. These are not high-volume, routine support queues,&amp;nbsp; they are the functions that handle sensitive guest and host interactions, carry high regulatory and reputational exposure, and demand a quality leader who understands the difference between behavioral compliance and genuine harm prevention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will arrive with a clear point of view on what world-class quality looks like in high-complexity, high-stakes support environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Program Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the Speciality quality strategy aligned to several critical priorities: breaking silos, aligning with stakeholders, defining a clear operating model, and driving measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish quality operating models with shared governance, consistent calibration standards, and clear accountability frameworks, while preserving the differentiation that each function requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Specialty quality in WBRs, MBRs, QBRs, and executive reviews; deliver a proactive narrative that surfaces emerging risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Quality Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee QA evaluation execution across all Specialty functions and partner sites globally, ensuring consistent application of QA processes and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root cause analysis on systemic failures, translating QA findings into product, process, and policy recommendations that go beyond agent-level coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formalize Audit the Auditor as an ongoing control: define sample selection, alignment thresholds, root cause review, and evaluator-level remediation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure every evaluation closes with a documented coaching action; build the tracking mechanisms to measure whether coaching is translating into performance improvement over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights, Reporting &amp;amp; Stakeholder Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish automated KPI reporting across all Speciality functions, eliminating manual processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement an NPS/predictive NPS detractor analysis framework, ensuring global patterns surface in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a Partner QA Performance Scorecard, establishing clear accountability for Calibration Accuracy, Evaluation Completeness, Critical Error Detection, Coaching Effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, AutoQA &amp;amp; Technology Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive AutoQA adoption across Specialty tiers, with particular focus on the attributes unique to Safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern the Responsible AI quality framework within Specialty: establish how Quality identifies, classifies, and escalates AI-model errors via CS Labs, and ensure this process is consistently applied and regularly reviewed as AI capabilities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI and analytics tools for Specialty insight generation and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a globally distributed team of Partner Quality Leads and Quality Insights Analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a One-Quality-Team culture that eliminates the cross-team divides: shared best practices, cross-regional learning, and proactive knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set high expectations and hold the team accountable for output quality, insight delivery, and stakeholder engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with peers to ensure one consistent quality voice across the portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years in Customer/Community Support, Quality, Operations, or Trust &amp;amp; Safety, with direct experience leading quality programs in sensitive, high-stakes, or regulated support environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree, preferably in related field required; MBA or Masters preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building or transforming quality programs for complex, non-routine support functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in quality methodologies (COPC, AQS, Six Sigma, Lean), with a proven ability to apply them to high-volume, complex support environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with QA tooling platforms, including hands-on ownership of form design, calibration management, and AutoQA deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing globally distributed quality teams across multiple functions, languages, and partner organizations in a 24/7 environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying or scaling AI/ML assisted QA tools (AutoQA, predictive NPS/CSAT).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence: able to influence senior stakeholders, present a unified quality narrative in leadership forums, and drive alignment across stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing vendor partner governance: calibration oversight, performance improvement plans, and escalation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;COPC certification; Six Sigma Green or Black Belt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Observe.AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in program management, change management, or organizational design within a high-growth tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or closely with BPO/vendor governance models at scale (1,000+ partner FTEs across multiple sites and geographies).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$192,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$235,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Fraud &amp;amp; Safety Investigations (FSI) is at the heart of keeping Airbnb safe for the millions of hosts and guests who trust our platform every day. As part of Global Operations, FSI investigates and enforces on fraud and safety cases across the full user lifecycle — from account creation to post-stay — leveraging a team of internal and partner agents operating 24/7 across the globe. We&#39;re entering a new chapter: building AI-native, self-service operational infrastructure that lets our teams move faster, make better decisions, and focus their energy where it matters most.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a new team — Scaled Services —focused on the foundational capabilities that the entire FSI organization depends on: how we launch, how we measure quality, how we build tools, and how we use data. As the Senior Manager leading Scaled Services, you&#39;ll be on the FSI leadership team and report directly to the Director of Fraud and Safety Investigations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead three teams spanning scaled implementation, data &amp;amp; internal tooling, and quality assurance and standards. This is a high-impact and leadership role: the process, tools, and systems your team builds and governs enables our global operational team to make the right decisions for our Airbnb community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own three outcomes for the org:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaled infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;Build the tools, automated data models, and automated workflows the entire org needs to function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-service velocity: &lt;/strong&gt;Create shared AI-ready data, metric definitions, and self-service infra so every domain and agent can move faster without depending on a centralized team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centralized quality governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as an objective, centralized evaluator of agent quality metrics — ensuring consistent standards across all domains without local bias.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Scaled Services team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage three people managers overseeing (1) Strategic Program Implementation, (2) Internal Tooling, and (3) Quality Assurance and Standards — plus one individual contributor leading self-serve data and business intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategy and operating rhythm for how Scaled Services delivers against FSI&#39;s roadmap, quality goals, and efficiency targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Scaled Services on the FSI leadership team, bringing the operational and technical perspective to org-wide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performance culture across a distributed team — with clear goals, regular coaching, and a bias toward accountability and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive scaled program implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and manage end-to-end launch delivery across FSI — from product and policy launches to workflow changes — ensuring every initiative lands on time, within budget, and at quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion rigorous solution design and testing practices before anything scales to partner sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Analytics, Policy, Program Management, and Shared Services (training, quality, knowledge management) to align on requirements and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable best in class agent tooling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the tools roadmap on behalf of the operations team, and drive successful implementation and adoption of tools strategy across the platform&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and test internal tooling workflow guides for agent case handling,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and advocate for innovative tooling improvements that improves agent efficiency and accuracy Support business continuity through RTB tooling support alongside engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the subject matter expert in technical tools and processes for operations across all fraud and safety domains and stay informed about industry trends, emerging technologies and competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build self-serve data and business intelligence tooling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team building internal tools and automated data models that power FSI operations — with a north star of full self-service through Claude + MCP integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the governance of shared metric definitions and data infrastructure so every team in FSI is working from the same source of truth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure FSI&#39;s data foundations are AI-ready: structured, governed, and accessible in ways that enable intelligent automation and agent self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Govern agent quality &amp;amp; workflow integrity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the team responsible for monitoring and improving workflow adherence, improve Overturn rates, and workflow quality across FSI — including User Acceptance Testing (UAT) for new launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the centralized, objective quality authority across FSI domains — preventing domain-level bias and ensuring consistent, defensible standards prior to each launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify systemic quality improvements by connecting quality findings to workflow, policy, and tooling gaps — not just surfacing issues, but advocating for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and partner cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Product, Engineering, Data Science, and Analytics partners to ensure FSI&#39;s needs are represented early and often in roadmap planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex operational and technical tradeoffs clearly to executive and senior leadership audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a thought partner to peers on the FSI leadership team, helping the org make better decisions through data, quality insights, and tooling capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in operations, strategy, or program management — ideally spanning both people-management and technical or data-adjacent work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years managing managers, with a track record of building and developing high-performing, distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multi-functional operations teams that sit at the intersection of process, tooling, and data — you&#39;ve built the infrastructure that makes organizations run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of data and analytics: you don&#39;t need to write SQL yourself, but you understand data architecture, metric governance, and what it takes to build self-service data systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to set quality standards at scale and govern them impartially — you&#39;ve built the systems and culture that make quality consistent, not just aspirational.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional influence skills: you know how to get things on product and engineering roadmaps, and how to hold partners accountable without burning bridges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, direct communicator — you can make complex programs and data concepts legible to any audience, from frontline leads to the C-suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Trust, Fraud, Safety, or a high-stakes operations environment is a plus, but not required — the right instincts for urgency, precision, and user impact matter more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$192,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$235,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community you will join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Supply Enablement &amp;amp; Activation Team is growing and we want you to be part of it! Airbnb is looking for a seasoned Senior Manager, Supply Enablement to join our team. In this role, you&#39;ll lead a team of enablement and activation specialists responsible for building world-class content, training programs, and GTM activation at scale — equipping our field, vendor, and operations teams with the knowledge, skills, and tools to consistently acquire, grow, and retain high-quality supply across Homes, Hotels, Services, and Experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role requires candidates to be based in the US. This role is not eligible for relocation support.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact leadership role for someone who has lived the reality of frontline sales and account management, knows how to build and develop high-performing enablement teams, and has a sophisticated command of AI-powered tools to make enablement smarter, faster, and more measurable. You&#39;ll set the strategic direction, raise the bar on quality and craft, and ensure everything your team produces drives real, measurable behavior change in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A typical day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of enablement managers and activation specialists responsible for content creation and curation, training development, and GTM program delivery; Set clear goals, priorities, and quality standards across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build team capacity and capabilities, including identifying skill gaps, investing in development, and hiring exceptional talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement Content &amp;amp; Program Strategy
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own with Enablement Director and Foundations + Quality Enablement Manager, the end-to-end enablement content strategy — ensuring your team focused on ‘front of house’ produces high-quality, audience-specific, evergreen assets including playbooks, pitch decks, objection handling guides, onboarding curricula, and certification programs. Guide your team in leveraging AI for content development, personalized learning, coaching at scale, and practice — pushing the boundaries of what&#39;s possible with the tools in your stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate CBO and Supply strategy into actionable enablement plays, working closely with your team to bring them to life for field, vendor, and scaled ops audiences and developing strong working relationships with those teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and uphold a high bar for enablement deliverables from onboarding to upskilling — ensuring content doesn&#39;t just inform, but changes behavior and drives measurable performance outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM Activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with regional leads (EMEA, AMER, APAC) and cross-functional stakeholders to land new product launches, strategic initiatives, policy &amp;amp; legal approved positioning, and sales plays in the field effectively and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong feedback loop between the field – across all 4 lines of business – and your team, so activation is continuously informed by what&#39;s actually working on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with RevOps, Product, Marketing, Community, and Policy to embed enablement insights into strategic initiatives and keep field teams ready to execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly report program performance, ROI, and team impact to senior leadership with clarity and credibility; Partner with Advanced Analytics to design experiments (A/B, ERF) that prove the incrementality of your team&#39;s investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in sales enablement, revenue enablement, or a closely related field — ideally within a high-growth tech or marketplace company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing and developing enablement or GTM teams — you know how to hire great people, set a high bar, and bring out the best in a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontline sales experience — you&#39;ve carried a quota, managed accounts, or worked directly in a sales motion and deeply understand what reps need to succeed; bonus if travel industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise with AI-powered enablement tools — hands-on experience with platforms like Gong, Highspot, Intellum, Seismic, or equivalent; you know how to drive real business value out of these tools and coach your team to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in instructional design and content strategy — you can tell the difference between content that informs and content that changes behavior, and you hold your team to that standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design and scale GTM activation programs across diverse, geographically distributed field and vendor teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a matrixed, cross-functional environment — you&#39;re comfortable influencing without authority and driving alignment across multiple senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data fluency — comfortable partnering with analytics teams to design experiments, interpret results, and present impact in business terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and executive presence — you can align a room, write a crisp strategy doc, and present to a VP with equal confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with vendor or outsourced sales team enablement is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with supply-side or marketplace dynamics (hosts, partners, agents) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a player-coach where needed — rolling up your sleeves on high-priority programs while developing your team&#39;s independence and craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
