&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked in public or high-growth SaaS/technology companies, ideally supporting global teams including Technical Solutions organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are both analytically rigorous and business savvy, able to translate data into actionable insights and influence decisions across cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
