&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1958&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2261635a59f5&quot;&gt;You have written or managed documentation as code, and are familiar with modern infrastructure such as IaaS cloud services and containers, as well as Git/GitHub and CI/CD tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2141&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aaea2df023c6&quot;&gt;You enjoy partnering with product managers, developers, and other SMEs to create robust technical documentation for developers and other types of users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
