&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2662&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3aee2c889f83&quot;&gt;A strong track record partnering across functions (Product, Finance, Engineering, Data) and aligning stakeholders with different priorities toward shared outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
