&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;546&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e9f74cb2a624&quot;&gt;Datadog is looking for a Partner Technology Solutions Engineer to join our fast-paced team. You will be the primary technical contact for our partners, guiding them through the entire integration lifecycle—from initial architectural design to final publication on the Datadog Marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
