&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1089&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cdc3e2a91d9c&quot;&gt;Act as the technical lead for partners, advising on OAuth flows, log pipelines, OpenTelemetry, and agent-based vs. API-based configurations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1232&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1c21d46466e&quot;&gt;Perform architectural assessments and deep-dive code reviews for partner integrations in the integrations-extras and marketplace repositories, ensuring they meet our Quality Rubric&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1416&quot; data-local-id=&quot;70e96cbc9595&quot;&gt;Solve complex technical challenges for partners via Zendesk, Slack, and dedicated technical consultations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1525&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8e5f860eed78&quot;&gt;Identify friction points in our Integration Developer Platform (IDP) and partner with our internal Product and Engineering teams to build a better developer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1696&quot; data-local-id=&quot;617aca1a40b7&quot;&gt;Maintain public-facing developer documentation and internal tracking systems (&lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;JIRA&lt;/span&gt;) to ensure transparency and scale&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
