&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1827&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7878e76ccbd&quot;&gt;A technical expert with 3+ years of experience in a technical role (Support Engineering, Solutions Architecture, or Software Development)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1968&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c33dc73d906&quot;&gt;Proficient in at least one language (Python or Go preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
