&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2032&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d1a31e3cfac2&quot;&gt;An observability enthusiast who understands monitoring fundamentals (Metrics, Logs, Traces) and modern standards like OpenTelemetry&lt;/p&gt;
