&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2284&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38a144cd8719&quot;&gt;A tinkerer who is comfortable working with APIs, Linux environments, and cloud infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
