&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1490&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73036351ff42&quot;&gt;Evaluate AI tools and vendors through hands-on experimentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1557&quot; data-local-id=&quot;50c5a9dd8ea3&quot;&gt;Enable the broader People team to adopt AI effectively and responsibly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1632&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b1b50d0240f1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Success in this role includes reducing manual People workflows by at least 20% through AI-enabled automation and intelligent system design.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1773&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1b3c25982665&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
