&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1844&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4cf39165da06&quot;&gt;Lead the product roadmap for IaC Detection, enabling customers to proactively detect and catch high-impact infrastructure and configuration changes before they are deployed into production and escalate into incidents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2066&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bc8ef35059b3&quot;&gt;Define the end-to-end experience across the Datadog UI, developer workflows (e.g. GitHub). Partner with Design and Engineering to create user-facing experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2231&quot; data-local-id=&quot;96bdea3009c0&quot;&gt;Work with customers, including Datadog, to drive adoption and iterate the product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2316&quot; data-local-id=&quot;128871308203&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with infrastructure monitoring, AI product teams, and other teams in Datadog to integrate IaC detection capabilities across the Datadog platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
