&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1222&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0547ad38f712&quot;&gt;Define how security teams can assess and manage the security posture of AI-enabled systems, including configuration risks, sensitive data exposure, and policy violations.&lt;/p&gt;
