&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2783&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f711ce27e44&quot;&gt;You have 3-5 years of experience as a Product Manager, ideally working on a developer-focused SaaS or infrastructure product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2911&quot; data-local-id=&quot;907866e8f3c0&quot;&gt;You have experience working on production-level AI projects, from conception through launch and iteration, ideally involving ML-driven insights, automated workflows or intelligent guidance in complex systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
