&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3623&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1fa4c37a6fa7&quot;&gt;You enjoy using AI to explore ideas, quickly prototype and then validate with customers to shape the roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
