&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3735&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb33d84e9e95&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with cloud applications, distributed tracing, performance analysis, microservices or profiling technologies; fluency in programming languages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
