&lt;li&gt;Learn to follow a well-defined methodology to help identify a customer&#39;s unique needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by a career in sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone with an innate curiosity to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a desire to succeed alongside teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven in your written and verbal communication&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with being able to learn from rejection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
