&lt;li&gt;Analytical and precise, able to communicate usage and cost impact clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with ambiguity, data anomalies, and edge cases, and committed to finding root causes that drive customer trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the below qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
