&lt;li&gt;For New York City, Washington, Washington D.C. and California (excluding Bay Area) based hires: Estimated annual salary of $361,000-$496,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Colorado, Illinois, Maryland and Minnesota based hires: Estimated annual salary of $328,000 - $450,000.&lt;/li&gt;
