&lt;li&gt;10+ years of Public Sector and Enterprise sales experience, ideally in SaaS, cybersecurity, networking, or cloud technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of C-level engagement and executive selling.&lt;/li&gt;
