&lt;li&gt;Technical Account Plan Ownership: Own and drive the end-to-end Technical Account Plan (TAP) for assigned strategic partners.&amp;nbsp; Act as the primary architect mapping partner business goals to technical execution milestones, ensuring continuous alignment on CF1 and AI adoption targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building Technical Champions: Identify, enable, and cultivate key technical advocates and &quot;Champions&quot; within the partner organization to scale Cloudflare expertise independently, generate Partner-Influenced Opportunities (PIO), and empower them to deliver high-value professional services around Zero Trust and AI application security.&lt;/li&gt;
