&lt;li&gt;Experience building relationships and driving technical wins across multi-stakeholder, enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloudflare platform certifications or meaningful hands-on deployment experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to DevOps, security operations, or emerging GenAI trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant industry certifications (cloud, security, networking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
