&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap. We&#39;re looking for builders — people who spot the &quot;normalized&quot; problem everyone else has learned to live with and have the curiosity and drive to fix it. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to move faster and sharing every improvement across the team. If you value curiosity over bureaucracy and see AI as a partner in solving hard problems, you&#39;ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role &amp;amp; the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Engineers on the Digital Native Enterprise team work with Cloudflare&#39;s most innovative and high-growth accounts — Cloud-native, technologically advanced companies building at internet scale. This role focuses on both the acquisition of new Digital Native accounts and the expansion of existing ones. The ideal candidate is a builder with a deep technical foundation and a commercial mindset, capable of engaging from the engineer in the weeds to the executive in the boardroom — across Application Development, Performance, Security, and Infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Engineer, you are a technologist embedded within the GTM organization. You own the technical relationship from initial discovery through onboarding, adoption, renewal, and expansion. You&#39;ll be delivering architectural value and measurable business outcomes across the entire customer lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Regional Customer Engineering Leader and partner closely with your aligned Account Executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Validation (Pre-Sales)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, design bespoke architectures, and deliver compelling demos and Proofs of Concept (PoCs) across Cloudflare&#39;s portfolio — Security, Networking, and Developer Platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technical champions and executive relationships within target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Cloudflare at industry events, developer communities, and cybersecurity conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Adoption &amp;amp; Value Realization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical contact from contract signature through full platform adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and oversee technical onboarding and implementation — you are the engineering relationship, not a handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor customer health telemetry, resolve integration bottlenecks, and ensure rapid time-to-value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial Accountability &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry a variable quota tied directly to new business acquisition and ongoing account growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive strategic cross-sell and upsell opportunities grounded in platform usage data and customer business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) that translate platform metrics into C-level ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted Advisory&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain continuous, deep relationships with key stakeholders — from engineering leads to CISOs and CTOs — throughout the entire customer lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on architecture best practices, security posture, and Cloudflare platform strategy aligned to customer business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding on The Life of a Request on the Internet&lt;/li&gt;
