&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Adoption &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and/or provide oversight to technical onboarding and implementation, serving as the primary executive and engineering contact for the customer. You will partner with Account Executives to own discovery, demos, onboarding, technical health, risk, and expansion strategy. You will proactively monitor dynamic customer health scores and telemetry to ensure rapid time-to-value and resolve integration bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
