&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For San Francisco based hires: Estimated annual salary of $231,000-$275,000+ OTE, Base + Commissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Los Angeles based hires: Estimated annual salary of $221,000 - $267,000 OTE, Base + Commissions.&lt;/li&gt;
