&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Undergraduate or graduate degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role may require travel up to 20–50% to attend customer meetings, conferences, industry events, and in-person team collaboration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role features a competitive base salary and a variable compensation structure tied directly to the successful execution of full-lifecycle commercial targets, including new business acquisition, ongoing adoption milestones, and overall account expansion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What Makes Cloudflare Special?&lt;/h3&gt;
