&lt;li&gt;Track record of production ownership, including monitoring, debugging, on-call, incident response, and ongoing reliability improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using metrics, logs, traces, profiling, and experiments to understand production behavior and validate improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to write clear technical designs and lead projects across team boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
