&lt;p&gt;Our Federal Government sales team works directly with Canadian departments and agencies to defend critical infrastructure, protect citizens&#39; data, and safeguard essential digital services against evolving cyber threats. By solving complex technical and security challenges for government, we help secure Canada’s public sector while supporting Cloudflare&#39;s global mission to help build a better, safer Internet for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
