&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for a seasoned sales professional with proven expertise selling to the Canadian Federal Government.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The candidate will possess both a sales and technical background that enables them to drive engagement at all levels with technical buyers, Project Authorities, and procurement leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Named Account Executive, you&#39;ll be responsible for developing and executing against a comprehensive account/territory plan across key defense and security accounts to achieve revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage early in the procurement lifecycle to shape technical requirements and leverage modern procurement pathways to drive business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The person in this role will also assist in creating and articulating compelling value propositions for Cloudflare services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage PSPC procurement vehicles, Supply Arrangements, Standing Offers (SOs), Vendor of Record (VOR) lists, and strategic channel partners to execute deals Navigate complex contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a robust sales pipeline Develop long-term strategic relationships with key accounts and system integrators Ensure customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
