&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Management team at Cloudflare steers the strategy, roadmap, and execution that powers a faster, more secure internet. As part of the Zero Trust Security organization, our Email Security team is redefining how the enterprise&#39;s most trusted — and most targeted — communication channel gets protected, evolving a platform already trusted by Fortune 500 and Global 2000 organizations into a fast, secure pillar natively integrated with Cloudflare&#39;s Zero Trust stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Email remains the most trusted, yet most targeted, communication channel in the enterprise. At Cloudflare, we have a proven email security solution which is trusted by Fortune 500 and Global 2000 organizations. We’re looking for an experienced, technical product manager to continue to differentiate our solution in the market, make difficult investment decisions, and own delivering an enterprise-grade email security platform that is fast, secure, and natively integrated with Cloudflare&#39;s Zero Trust stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an autonomous, determined, and pragmatic individual who possesses strong conviction, humility, and a decisive bias toward action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll be responsible for defining how some of the world&#39;s most sophisticated organizations protect their communication, leading the industry&#39;s shift away from legacy &quot;boxes&quot; toward an AI-first, cloud-native, and identity-aware security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities involve continuously investing in threat intelligence, sustaining current security detection capabilities, rapidly developing features, and expanding into new markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Email Security.&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and own the strategic roadmap for our Email Security solution, ensuring Cloudflare remains the definitive answer to evolving threats like Business Email Compromise (BEC) and advanced phishing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Intelligence and Detections.&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside our Threat Intelligence and Detections teams to improve how customers consume, enforce, and understand Cloudflare One. Influence product direction, connect customer needs across the enterprise and own selected initiatives when dedicated leadership will accelerate an important outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Zero Trust Security.&lt;/strong&gt; Bolster the seamless integration of Email Security into the broader Cloudflare stack, architecting a &quot;better together&quot; experience that bridges Gateway, CASB, and DLP into a single, powerhouse defense layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talk to Customers&lt;/strong&gt;. Build trust with engineering and sales by rigorously documenting first-hand experiences with internal and external customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive new business.&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the strategic engine for growth, building the features and competitive differentiators needed to displace legacy incumbents and win the hearts and minds of Global 2000 CISOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evangelize the Platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Use the product daily and serve as a technical and strategic leader, representing the Email Security vision to internal stakeholders, the sales field, and the broader security community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; as product manager, with a proven track record of owning and scaling complex enterprise security products in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be customer obsessed.&lt;/strong&gt; At Cloudflare, we serve the needs of customers large and small, and our product managers need to be comfortable understanding how to design for enterprises without compromising the experience for individuals and small businesses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write Persuasively.&lt;/strong&gt; The best product managers at Cloudflare are exceptional storytellers. They distill complex ideas into simple ones by using context, empathy, transparency, and evidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with conviction.&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading with conviction to build products designed to win in a highly competitive market, with a focus on feature differentiation and displacement strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain domain knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable navigating architectural trade-offs with senior engineers regarding mail flow (M365/Google Workspace), cloud infrastructure, and API performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have high ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable being accountable for the entire product lifecycle, from high-fidelity PRDs to collaborating with cross-functional teams for global launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data-driven decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to leverage complex datasets to build intuitive conviction in your views and effectively persuade others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be an early adopter.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve enthusiastically adopted the latest generation of agentic coding tools, and you can use them effectively to navigate a codebase, dependency mapping, or prototype experiences for your feature area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in Zero Trust security.&lt;/strong&gt; A deep understanding of modern security architectures and the value of a unified platform approach (Identity, Device, and Data security).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with detections.&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with the mechanics of modern email threats and how machine learning can be used for detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good design sense.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re comfortable collaborating with design engineers to translate the requirements into lo-fi prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
