&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare is seeking a Tax Analyst to join our collaborative team.&amp;nbsp; This position will have a broad range of responsibilities with a primary focus on income tax.&amp;nbsp; You will report to the Senior Director of Tax and work with other members of the tax and finance teams, collaborating with cross-functional business partners from time-to-time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare quarterly and annual income tax provision and forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal and external partners to help manage U.S. federal, state and local income tax filings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with M&amp;amp;A transactions, focusing on tax due diligence and post-merger integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with analysis and preparation of stock based compensation models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with ad hoc requests and projects as necessary, including but not limited to tax research projects, R&amp;amp;D tax credit studies, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the digital transformation of our tax function, identifying and executing process improvements through technology, automation, and AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful candidate will be open to exploring all areas of tax as this role could evolve into 80/20 percent direct/indirect taxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors degree in Accounting, Finance or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of significant experience at a public accounting firm and/or corporate tax department of a multinational company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Excel and AI technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail with analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and inquisitive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to interact effectively internally as well as with external service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
