&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience dealing with the assigned territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience selling network security or CDN services to commercial accounts will be beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 - 10 years direct experience selling to commercial accounts acting as lead seller and relationship owner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background in engineering, computer science, or MIS a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
